            "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes — illuminated signs (backlit acrylic, channel letters) cost more up front because they include an electrical component and, almost always, a separate electrical permit on top of the standard sign permit. They're worth it for a storefront that needs to be visible after dark, but budget for both the fabrication and the permitting when you're planning one." }
