        <li>Price match guarantee &mdash; beat any quote by 10%</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="color:var(--grey-light);font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:1rem;"><strong style="color:var(--white);">Get a free quote:</strong> (727) 494-6162 or <a href="/contact/" style="color:var(--red);text-decoration:underline;">request a quote online</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content-block">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2rem;align-items:flex-start;">
        <div style="flex:0 0 auto;width:80px;height:80px;background:var(--red);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--white);font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.8rem;">FV</div>
