          <div style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.85rem;letter-spacing:0.12em;color:var(--red);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">About the Author</div>
          <h3 style="color:var(--white);font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:0.6rem;">Fly Visuals Owner</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--grey-light);font-size:0.92rem;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:0.8rem;">Based in Port Richey, FL. Founder of Fly Visuals, fabricating signs, vehicle wraps, and window tinting for the Tampa Bay and Pasco County market.</p>
          <p style="color:var(--grey);font-size:0.82rem;line-height:1.7;">This guide reflects real shop experience fabricating and installing signs in Florida's sun, humidity, and storm conditions. It's updated as material options and local requirements evolve.</p>
