        'business-signs':   'Got a full signage package for our new Wesley Chapel storefront — window lettering, door graphics, and an A-frame. Everything is consistent, professional, and exactly what we envisioned. Great value and fast turnaround.',
        'indoor-signs':     'Our Wesley Chapel office lobby sign is stunning. Fly Visuals nailed the dimensional lettering and the finish matches our brand perfectly. Clients always compliment it when they walk in. Couldn\'t be happier.',
