        faq: [
          { q: 'Can you handle all the signage for a new Wesley Chapel business opening?', a: 'Yes — and this is one of the most common projects we do for the Wesley Chapel market. We\'ll put together a full signage package: storefront sign, window lettering, interior lobby sign, hours sign, and whatever else your location needs. Everything designed consistently, everything produced here, everything installed on your timeline. A lot of new Wesley Chapel business owners find it much easier to deal with one shop for the whole job.' },
