      'residential-tinting': {
        h2: 'Residential Window Tinting in Wesley Chapel, FL',
        body: `Wesley Chapel homes are beautiful — newer construction, great neighborhoods, lots of natural light. But that natural light comes with a price in Florida: heat, glare, and UV damage to floors, furniture, and everything inside. West and south-facing windows in Wesley Chapel homes take the brunt of Florida\'s afternoon sun, and without window film, your A/C runs harder, your energy bills climb every summer, and your hardwood floors and furniture fade faster than they should.

Residential window tinting from Fly Visuals blocks solar heat before it enters your home, reducing cooling costs while maintaining your view and natural light. For Wesley Chapel homeowners in Seven Oaks, Meadow Pointe, Wiregrass Ranch, and the surrounding communities, it\'s one of the smartest upgrades you can make to a Florida home. We come to your Wesley Chapel property, assess your windows, and complete most homes in a single day.`,
        faq: [
          { q: 'Will window tinting reduce my energy bills in Wesley Chapel?', a: 'Wesley Chapel homeowners with significant west or south-facing glass consistently see their A/C running less after window film is installed. The exact savings depend on your home\'s window count, orientation, and insulation — but blocking solar heat at the glass before it enters is objectively more effective than blinds or curtains that trap heat inside after it\'s already come through. Most Wesley Chapel customers recover the cost of the film over time through energy savings.' },
          { q: 'How long does residential window tinting take for a Wesley Chapel home?', a: 'Most single-family homes in Wesley Chapel are completed in one day. We come to your property, clean and prep the glass, install the film, and leave the space clean. The film takes 2 to 4 weeks to fully cure — during that time you may see minor haziness that disappears as it sets. After that, your windows are tinted permanently until you decide to change or remove them.' }
        ]
