      'commercial-tinting': {
        h2: 'Commercial Window Tinting in Wesley Chapel, FL',
        body: `Wesley Chapel\'s commercial buildings deal with serious solar heat gain — especially the south and west-facing glass in the retail centers along SR-56 and the office buildings throughout the Wiregrass and Bruce B Downs corridor. If your employees are uncomfortable in the afternoon or your A/C is running constantly during peak hours, commercial window film is one of the most cost-effective fixes available.

