        faq: [
          { q: 'Can you tint a commercial building in Wesley Chapel without closing it?', a: 'Yes — and we specifically plan commercial installs around your schedule. For businesses on SR-56 or Bruce B Downs that can\'t afford downtime, we work in sections, or after hours, or on weekends. Tell us your constraints when you get the quote and we\'ll build a schedule that keeps your Wesley Chapel business running.' },
          { q: 'What commercial buildings in Wesley Chapel benefit most from window film?', a: 'West-facing offices and retail spaces along SR-56 and Bruce B Downs get the most dramatic results — those exposures take Florida\'s brutal late-afternoon sun directly. Medical offices and professional spaces where patient and employee comfort matters also see big benefits. Restaurants with afternoon dining service benefit from reduced glare and more comfortable table temperatures.' }
