      'fleet-graphics': {
        h2: 'Fleet Graphics for Wesley Chapel Companies',
        body: `Fleet graphics for Wesley Chapel businesses — consistent logos, contact info, and brand messaging across every vehicle in your operation — are one of the most visible and cost-effective marketing investments in a growth market like Wesley Chapel. When three or four consistently branded vehicles are working the SR-56 corridor, the Wiregrass area, or the residential communities of Seven Oaks and Meadow Pointe every day, it builds brand recognition faster than almost any other local marketing channel.

Fly Visuals provides fleet graphics packages for Wesley Chapel companies of all sizes — from 2-vehicle operations to large commercial fleets. Volume pricing, in-house design, and staggered installation scheduling to minimize downtime.`,
        faq: [
          { q: 'How much does fleet graphics cost for a Wesley Chapel service company?', a: 'Fleet graphics pricing depends on the number of vehicles, coverage level (lettering only vs. full graphics package), and design complexity. The more vehicles in the project, the better the per-vehicle price. For a typical Wesley Chapel service company with 3 to 5 vans, we can provide a detailed quote that covers design, production, and installation. Contact us for a free fleet assessment.' },
          { q: 'Can you keep all our fleet vehicles looking consistent in Wesley Chapel?', a: 'That\'s exactly what fleet graphics are designed to do. We create a master design template, match colors precisely across every vehicle, and install with the same quality standard on every unit. Whether you have 2 vehicles or 20, every one will look like it came from the same professional operation — which is exactly what Wesley Chapel customers want to see before they call.' }
